  "/api/v1/meetings/{meetingId}/messages": {
   "get": {
    "description": "Cursor-paginated transcript (M16-X2).\n\n``limit`` (default 100, hard-capped at 500 \u2014 larger values are clamped,\nnot rejected) sizes the page. ``before=<messageSeq>`` returns the page\nof messages strictly OLDER than that stable 1-based transcript position.\nBody shape is ``{items, hasMore}`` per the frozen api-conventions\npagination rule; every item carries its ``messageSeq``.\n\nOLDER-MESSAGES FETCH PATTERN (frontend / X-lane consumers):\n  1. First paint:      GET .../messages                -> newest window\n     (last 100 by default); render bottom-anchored.\n  2. Scroll to top:    if body.hasMore is true, GET\n     .../messages?limit=N&before=<items[0].messageSeq>\n     and PREPEND the returned items \u2014 pages chain with no gap and no\n     overlap because every page ends exactly where the previous began.\n  3. Repeat until hasMore is false: the transcript head is reached.\n  Do NOT cache messageSeq across meetings; seqs are per-transcript\n  positions, not global ids. A cursor for a message that no longer\n  exists resolves to an honest empty page ({items: [], hasMore: false}).",
    "operationId": "get_messages_api_v1_meetings__meetingId__messages_get",
    "parameters": [
     {
      "in": "path",
      "name": "meetingId",
      "required": true,
      "schema": {
       "title": "Meetingid",
       "type": "string"
      }
     },
     {
      "in": "query",
      "name": "limit",
      "required": false,
      "schema": {
       "anyOf": [
        {
         "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
         "type": "integer"
        },
        {
         "type": "null"
        }
       ],
       "title": "Limit"
      }
     },
     {
      "in": "query",
      "name": "before",
      "required": false,
      "schema": {
       "anyOf": [
        {
         "type": "string"
        },
        {
         "type": "null"
        }
       ],
       "title": "Before"
      }
     }
    ],
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessagePageOut"
        }
       }
      },
      "description": "Successful Response"
     },
     "404": {
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/_ErrorEnvelope"
        }
       }
      },
      "description": "unknown meeting"
     },
     "422": {
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
        }
       }
      },
      "description": "Validation Error"
     }
    },
    "summary": "Get Messages",
    "tags": [
     "meetings"
    ]
   },
